<!--
  Repeat is off: the same arrows, struck through.

  A stroke rather than a hollow outline. The shade draws these small and monochrome, and an
  outlined version of a filled icon reads as a different icon rather than as the same one turned
  off - whereas a line through something is the one mark everybody already reads as "not".
-->
